note as IMMUTABILITY_diagram_15_chart
  VERSIONING RULE
  Signed versions are immutable. Corrections create a new version or addendum
  linked by supersedes_version_id. Database audit history is not a substitute
  for clinical version history. The patient can view every released version;
  withholding requires an explicit legal/clinical reason and audit event.
end note


